WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- Well, I, you know,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.210
I got to hang out with my children

00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.400
because we came off the road.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.030
So I have a five-year-old
and a three-year-old,

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.830
so I really got to, you
know, connect with them,

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:09.663
which was really nice,

00:00:09.663 --> 00:00:11.460
because like two weeks before
this whole thing happened

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.293
and we stopped working,

00:00:12.293 --> 00:00:15.090
my daughter told me that she
loves when I come to visit,

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.100
which really hit home.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.140
So it's nice to
- Oh, God!

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.830
actually be a father

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.040
and not feel like an
uncle in my own house.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.873
So that was good.

00:00:22.873 --> 00:00:26.020
And then I popped into high school Zooms.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.640
Like there was, there was Zoom classes,

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.710
and I secretly went out on
Instagram and I would...

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:34.370
I like hooked up with teachers
and said give me the login

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.690
and I'll pop into these high school Zooms,

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.860
'cause I know how hard it was
for the teachers and the kids.

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:38.750
So it was a fun surprise.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.640
I would pretend to be a kid
messing around in the class

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:42.900
and then they would realize who I was,

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.210
and it'd be a nice surprise

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.160
for everybody.
- Oh, that's so cool!

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.610
Putting my children are nice.

